%%{ init: { "theme": "dark" } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Admin User
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server (Bun)
    participant G as Google OAuth2

    Note over B,S: Login Flow
    U->>B: Acessa /login
    B->>S: GET /login
    S->>B: login.html (com GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID)
    U->>B: Clica "Sign in with Google"
    B->>G: Google Sign-In popup
    G->>B: credential (JWT id_token)
    B->>S: POST /auth/google {credential}
    S->>G: GET /tokeninfo?id_token=...
    G->>S: {email, aud, email_verified}

    alt Email na whitelist
        S->>S: createSession(email)<br/>HMAC-SHA256(email:expires, SECRET)
        S->>B: 200 + Set-Cookie: serafim_session
        B->>S: GET /admin/ (com cookie)
        S->>S: getSession() verifica HMAC + expiry
        S->>B: admin panel HTML
    else Email nao autorizado
        S->>B: 403 "Email nao autorizado"
    end

    Note over B,S: Session Validation (every request)
    B->>S: Request /api/* ou /admin/*
    S->>S: Parse cookie serafim_session
    S->>S: Split email:expires:signature
    S->>S: Verify HMAC(email:expires) == signature
    S->>S: Check expires > Date.now()

    alt Sessao valida
        S->>S: Processa request
    else Sessao invalida/expirada
        S->>B: 302 Redirect /login (HTML)<br/>ou 401 (API)
    end

    Note over B,S: CSRF Protection
    B->>S: POST /api/* (state-changing)
    S->>S: Check Origin header
    alt Origin em ALLOWED_ORIGINS ou ausente
        S->>S: Processa request
    else Origin nao permitido
        S->>B: 403 "Origem nao permitida"
    end

    Note over B,S: Logout
    U->>B: Clica Logout
    B->>S: GET /auth/logout
    S->>B: Set-Cookie: serafim_session=; Max-Age=0<br/>302 Redirect /login
